  <item>
    <title>vol.3 对我们的99个提问！（一）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6298ae44d02ea2b34ca88456</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6298ae44d02ea2b34ca88456</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jun 2022 12:34:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>超——长的 Q&amp;A 闲聊一。这期我们聊了杂七杂八、学习、恋爱交友相关的问题，我们的发言参考价值也许不高，仅供娱乐！也期待大家在评论里分享你的看法，我们一起发散讨论～</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期 Q&amp;A 主题预告：兴趣爱好、观点、未来发展</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们回答了（部分摘录）：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 大仔小仔的音色有什么区别吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 推荐的电影/电视剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 怎样理财、储蓄</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 如何克服 peer pressure</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> 身材焦虑怎么办</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a> MBTI 都分别是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> 玩手机的时候都玩什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2788">46:28</a> 是用什么相机设备</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">54:08</a> 怎么摆脱拖延</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4292">01:11:32</a> 怎么才能让自己保持专注</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4465">01:14:25</a> 怎样能够拥有高行动力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4771">01:19:31</a> 会要求自己定期读书吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4796">01:19:56</a> 怎么处理琐碎又庞大的网络信息</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5012">01:23:32</a> 能否聊聊收纳心得</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5570">01:32:50</a> 如何交朋友？交朋友最看重什么呢</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5862">01:37:42</a> 什么样的男生会吸引到你</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6273">01:44:33</a> 怎么处理人际关系问题</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>-</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>我们是谁</span></h3><span></span><p><span>三个赶在 Z 世代尾巴上的过气手帐博主。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>大仔：谁都看不出来我是干嘛的。微博@DASEINVERSE</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>小仔：立志做奋斗逼，还没找到最想做的事所以成了东搞西搞的拖延症。微博@秋日记本</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>瓜瓜：整理狂，什么都爱尝试但都半吊子水的设计师，靠着积蓄 gap year 中。微博 @被掐死的兔子</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h3><span>关于「瓜言仔语」</span></h3><span></span><p><span>瓜言仔语是一个闲聊成长反思的记录类播客。我们不输出深度内容，而是想记录观点碰撞下彼此的成长。在这里会有很多「转念一想」的打脸时刻，坦然承认错误也是一种美德。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望能成为你隔着网线的朋友。</span></p>]]></description>
